 (5590, 1028, '_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp', ''),
 (5592, 1029, 'short-description', 'NOTHING ADDS CHARM AS WELL AS A BEAUTIFUL SMILE! It is a truth as old as the world itself. Equally true is the fact that beautiful teeth cannot be equated with healthy teeth. So if we want to enjoy healthy teeth for as long as possible, we have to take special care of them.'),
 (5593, 1029, '_thumbnail_id', '92'),
 (5594, 1029, '_edit_lock', '1695409120:1'),
 (5595, 1029, '_edit_last', '1'),
 (5596, 1029, '_short-description', 'field_64f62c1cd97b9'),
 (5597, 1029, '_yoast_wpseo_content_score', '30'),
 (5598, 1029, '_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes', '3'),
 (5599, 1029, '_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp', ''),
 (5600, 433, '_yoast_wpseo_content_score', '90'),
 (5601, 433, '_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes', '3'),
 (5602, 433, '_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp', ''),
 (5604, 1030, 'short-description', 'The stars shine the brightest and that is why every trend starts from them. They know that a beautiful smile makes a stronger impression than perfect make-up, hair style or elaborate outfit. It is said that in their world no career is possible without talent and Hollywood smile. One of the most popular, most fashionable and quickest aesthetic dentistry procedures is teeth whitening. This procedure will make your face take on a new brilliance.'),
 (5605, 1030, '_thumbnail_id', '98'),
 (5606, 1030, '_edit_lock', '1695409271:1'),
 (5607, 1030, '_edit_last', '1'),
 (5608, 1030, '_short-description', 'field_64f62c1cd97b9'),
 (5609, 1030, '_yoast_wpseo_content_score', '90'),
 (5610, 1030, '_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes', '2'),
 (5611, 1030, '_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp', ''),
 (5613, 1031, 'short-description', 'They dance barefoot on the grass, they try to count the stars, they collect dinosaurs and believe in tooth fairies. They have freckles and curls, bruised knees and soiled faces. They ask why money doesn’t grow on trees, where the wind blows and how hot the sun is. They have their favourite teddy bears, cars without wheels and they trust you like no one else in the world. Therefore, dear Parent, you cannot let your child down.'),
 (5614, 1031, '_thumbnail_id', '94'),
 (5615, 1031, '_edit_lock', '1695409315:1'),
 (5616, 1031, '_edit_last', '1'),
 (5617, 1031, '_short-description', 'field_64f62c1cd97b9'),
 (5618, 1031, '_yoast_wpseo_content_score', '30'),
 (5619, 1031, '_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes', '2'),
 (5620, 1031, '_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp', ''),
 (5622, 1033, 'short-description', 'There are many things that we remember from childhood: candy floss on a stick, blowing dandelions, playing dominoes. When we become adults, we focus on different things, but still remember the childhood tastes and games. We know exactly what domino effect is. It also applies to our teeth. Teeth form a coherent whole, like a harmonious team, where even the lack of a single player might can lead to confusion.'),
 (5623, 1033, '_thumbnail_id', '102'),
 (5624, 1033, '_edit_lock', '1695409403:1'),
 (5625, 1033, '_edit_last', '1'),
 (5626, 1033, '_short-description', 'field_64f62c1cd97b9'),
 (5627, 1033, '_yoast_wpseo_content_score', '30'),
 (5628, 1033, '_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes', '3'),
 (5629, 1033, '_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp', ''),
 (5631, 1034, 'short-description', 'There are always some “shadows” behind the success of famous people. Modest, discreet, invisible, but they decide about everything. There is always the darker side of the coin, the world behind the curtain and unfinished coffee. Everything counts after all, even the things we do not pay much attention to. Beautiful and healthy smile always meets with standing ovation. And what’s behind? Healthy gums. They are behind the success of our dentition. They quietly do a great job, not complaining about lack of holidays or overtime. They are the faithful companions and loyal servants. They act as confidants and best friends…Now the time has come to come out of the shadow…'),
 (5632, 1034, '_thumbnail_id', '106'),
 (5633, 1034, '_edit_lock', '1695409434:1'),
 (5634, 1034, '_edit_last', '1'),
 (5635, 1034, '_short-description', 'field_64f62c1cd97b9'),
 (5636, 1034, '_yoast_wpseo_content_score', '30'),
 (5637, 1034, '_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes', '3'),
 (5638, 1034, '_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp', ''),
 (5640, 1035, 'short-description', 'It’s difficult to keep up with fashion. Even the biggest trendsetters know that.Seasons change fast, and so does the content of our wardrobes, if we want to remain up-to-date. But there is one thing that never goes out of fashion – a beautiful smile. No matter the season, the time of day or that red colour and high-heeled shoes are currently being worn by celebrities. A perfect smile is still more important than fashion fads. Even aspiring for it has become trendy. Hollywood stars proudly wear dental braces. Age or profession doesn’t matter. All over the world there are actors, presenters, singers and politicians with braces on their teeth. Since a beautiful smile became a real asset in professional and private life, orthodontics was hailed as one of the most popular and fastest developing fields of dentistry.'),
 (5641, 1035, '_thumbnail_id', '108'),
 (5642, 1035, '_edit_lock', '1695409494:1'),
 (5643, 1035, '_edit_last', '1'),
 (5644, 1035, '_short-description', 'field_64f62c1cd97b9'),
 (5645, 1035, '_yoast_wpseo_content_score', '30'),
 (5646, 1035, '_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes', '3'),
 (5647, 1035, '_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp', ''),
 (5648, 393, '_yoast_wpseo_content_score', '60'),
 (5649, 393, '_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes', '1'),
 (5650, 393, '_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp', ''),
 (5651, 400, '_yoast_wpseo_content_score', '30'),
 (5652, 400, '_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes', '6'),
 (5653, 400, '_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp', ''),
 (5654, 398, '_yoast_wpseo_content_score', '90'),
 (5655, 398, '_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes', '1'),
 (5656, 398, '_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp', ''),
 (5658, 1036, 'short-description', 'Nothing can ruin our looks more than a missing tooth, particularly one in the front part of the dental arch. This was known already to the Maya people from Central America, who restored missing teeth using seashells several hundred years BC. Later came the use of cow bone, iron, and even 18-carat gold implants. And so, step by step, came the year 1960, when the first pure titanium implant was used. Missing teeth are not just about aesthetics, but above all health. Impaired chewing ability, difficulties eating and drinking, inhibitions. All that makes the problem of missing teeth greater than patients usually think. That is why implants are a perfect solution for achieving a healthy smile. Owing to permanent tooth restoration, they restore radiance to your smile. Because only pre-school pupils look cute with a missing tooth…'),
 (5659, 1036, '_thumbnail_id', '124'),
 (5660, 1036, '_edit_lock', '1695409689:1'),
 (5661, 1036, '_edit_last', '1'),
 (5662, 1036, '_short-description', 'field_64f62c1cd97b9'),
 (5663, 1036, '_yoast_wpseo_content_score', '30'),
 (5664, 1036, '_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes', '3'),
 (5665, 1036, '_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp', ''),
 (5667, 1037, 'short-description', 'We usually associate healthy, snow-white teeth with cinema stars. They can disarm the most dangerous weapon with their ideal smile. And even though the dream factory is famous for its “Hollywood smile”, it doesn’t mean that you can only afford to be a star in the land of the Statue of Liberty. You can become one as well and you should start with an ideal smile.'),
