 (6218, 1066, 'o_nas_label', 'DENTAL CLINIC IN WARSAW'),
 (6219, 1066, 'o_nas_tytul', 'VILLA NOVA DENTAL CLINIC'),
 (6220, 1066, 'o_nas_opis', 'It gives me great pleasure to invite you to the Villa Nova Dental Clinic, a place created out of a passion for treating and bringing out the natural beauty of the smile that lies within each of us.\r\n\r\nFrom an early age, I watched my mother work - a dentist with exceptional skills and approach to patients. It was she who instilled in me the interest and belief in the incredible opportunities to give something special to her patients that dentistry and my great passion, orthodontics, offers. It was to her that I dedicated myself professionally, while seeing that it is only when combined with the techniques of cosmetic dentistry and implantology that the effect we can achieve is truly incredible. Today I have the pleasure of working with perfectionists, with the highest qualifications, great knowledge and enormous experience, in every field of dentistry.\r\n\r\nThe most beautiful reward for the work of my team is a beautiful, radiant and captivating smile. I sincerely believe in its power, the effect it can have - how much self-confidence it can give us, how it influences others\' perception of us, and finally how helpful it can be in many situations in private and professional life.\r\n\r\nIt is particularly satisfying for me to be able to contribute to positive visual, and therefore often emotional, changes in our patients.\r\n\r\nIn response to the sophisticated needs and individual expectations of the most demanding patients, I have created the dental clinic of my dreams, where the art of aesthetics meets the latest technology. Where nothing is impossible. A place where you can feel safe, comfortable and special from the very first visit.\r\n\r\n<strong>You are cordially invited</strong>\r\n<strong>Dr. Emma Kiworkowa, MD</strong>\r\n<strong>with the team of VILLA NOVA DENTAL CLINIC</strong>'),
