 (1097, 6, '2023-09-25 13:05:06', '2023-09-25 11:05:06', 'Certified dental hygienist. She gained knowledge and experience by participating in many courses and trainings in the field of dental hygiene.\r\nShe assists in surgical, periodontal and orthodontic procedures. She graduated from the Faculty of Tourism and Recreation.', 'Zega Agnieszka', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'agnieszka-zega-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 17:23:11', '2023-09-27 15:23:11', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1097', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1098, 6, '2023-09-25 13:05:33', '2023-09-25 11:05:33', 'A graduate of the Faculty of Dental Hygiene at the Medical University of Warsaw.\r\n\r\nShe obtained her diploma defending her BA thesis on: “The role of a Dental Hygienist in the preparation and follow-up care of a prosthetically treated patient.”\r\n\r\nOn a daily basis, she assists in prosthetics, cosmetic dentistry and orthodontics.', 'Kolasa Magdalena', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'magdalena-kolasa-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 21:10:33', '2023-09-27 19:10:33', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1098', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1099, 6, '2023-09-25 13:06:00', '2023-09-25 11:06:00', '<div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">\r\n\r\nCertified dental hygienist. She has gained experience in the USA and Poland. Participant of many training courses in the field of dental prophylaxis.\r\n\r\n</div>', 'Filipek Izabela', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'izabela-filipek-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 17:22:56', '2023-09-27 15:22:56', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1099', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1100, 6, '2023-09-25 13:06:39', '2023-09-25 11:06:39', 'From the early school years, I associated my professional career with medicine, dentistry fascinated me in high school.\r\n\r\nI graduated from the Medical University of Warsaw in the field of dental hygiene in 2007. I obtained my diploma in dental hygienist with a very good result, defending my thesis on: “Tooth hypersensitivity – problem or disease.” I obtained my master’s degree at the University of Warsaw, graduating in Healthcare Management, thanks to the defense of the thesis on: “Marketing mix tools as a path to the success of a dental office”.\r\n\r\nIn my professional work I deal with prophylaxis and oral hygiene, carrying out professional hygiene treatments. He is also actively whitening living teeth. For several years I have been actively and passionately working in the profession of a dental hygienist. Willing to share my knowledge and experience, I conduct professional training for dental hygienists.\r\n\r\nI believe that the best reward in my work is patient satisfaction. The title of Dental Hygienist of the Year 2015, which I have obtained, can prove it.', 'Bartoszuk Jolanta', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'jolanta-bartoszuk-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 17:22:51', '2023-09-27 15:22:51', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1100', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1101, 6, '2023-09-25 13:07:09', '2023-09-25 11:07:09', 'Certified dental hygienist.\r\nShe actively expands her knowledge and develops skills. She assists in procedures in the field of orthodontics, endodontics and periodontics.', 'Baranowska Paulina', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'paulina-baranowska-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 21:07:45', '2023-09-27 19:07:45', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1101', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1102, 6, '2023-09-25 13:07:41', '2023-09-25 11:07:41', 'Adriana graduated from the Medical University of Warsaw, 1st Dentistry Division, with specialisation in Dental Hygiene.\r\n\r\nShe participated in many trainings and courses in the area of dentistry and oral hygiene in Poland and abroad. She is also a graduate of the College of Management.', 'Stacewicz Adrianna', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'adriana-stacewicz-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 17:22:41', '2023-09-27 15:22:41', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1102', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1103, 6, '2023-09-25 13:09:12', '2023-09-25 11:09:12', 'A graduate of the Medical University of Warsaw in the field of physiotherapy.\r\nShe is also a qualified dental hygienist. Actively improves and extends knowledge and professional skills.', 'Marek-Skura Katarzyna', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'katarzyna-marek-skura-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 17:22:31', '2023-09-27 15:22:31', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1103', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1104, 6, '2023-09-25 13:09:37', '2023-09-25 11:09:37', 'She received a diploma in dental hygienist at the Warsaw Medical University in 2009 defending the work entitled “Healthy periodontal condition for general health.” She continued her studies at the University of Warsaw in the field of Management in health care. She in an author of publications in dental journals. She is founder and editor of the Dent Press blog and speaker at conferences for the dental team.\r\nA member of the scientific committee of the 3rd and 4th National Olympiad of Dental Hygienists. A member of the Polish Academy of Dental Prevention. From 2016, she co- creates the Dental Trainer project by conducting professional training for dental hygienists and assistants.', 'Kopciewicz-Kozicka Karolina', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'karolina-kopciewicz-kozicka-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 17:22:26', '2023-09-27 15:22:26', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1104', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1105, 6, '2023-09-25 13:10:06', '2023-09-25 11:10:06', 'A graduate of the Faculty of Dental Hygiene at the Medical University of Warsaw.\r\n\r\nShe obtained the diploma of Dental Hygienist by defending the thesis “Loss of tooth hard tissues of non-carious origin – the role of a dental hygienist.”\r\n\r\nParticipant of various types of trainings and conferences in the field of dentistry and oral hygiene.\r\n\r\nOn a daily basis, she assists the doctors with treatments in every field of dentistry.', 'Konopka Martyna', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'martyna-konopka-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 17:22:20', '2023-09-27 15:22:20', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1105', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1107, 6, '2023-09-25 13:10:34', '2023-09-25 11:10:34', 'She graduated from the Medical University of Silesia in 2010.\r\nFor 8 years, she gained experience in the Czech Republic in Prague under the supervision of outstanding doctors in a renowned clinic, which taught her a holistic approach to patients and precision of work.\r\n\r\nShe participates in numerous courses and trainings in Poland and abroad, a graduate of the Curriculum of the Dawson Academy.\r\nThe area of her interest is prosthetics and cosmetic dentistry, always full of empathy towards her patients.\r\nPrivately, a mother of two wonderful daughters.', 'Ziomek-Rogacz Dominika', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'dominika-ziomek-rogacz-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 21:17:16', '2023-09-27 19:17:16', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1107', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1108, 6, '2023-09-25 13:11:00', '2023-09-25 11:11:00', 'Orthodontist. A graduate of the Medical Academy in Warsaw – 2006. Doctor of medical sciences – defense of thesis in the field of endodontics in 2014, specialist in dentistry with endodontics – specialization completed in 2012, specialist in orthodontics – National Specialization Examination passed in 2021 – professional path associated with the Medical University of Warsaw and the Military Institute of Medicine. Since 2018 member of the Polish Orthodontic Society.\r\n\r\nPrivately, a mother of three wonderful daughters and a travel lover.', 'Zanio-Kulaszewska Agnieszka', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'agnieszka-zanio-kulaszewska-en', '', '', '2023-11-20 07:40:24', '2023-11-20 06:40:24', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1108', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1109, 6, '2023-09-25 13:11:28', '2023-09-25 11:11:28', 'A graduate of the Medical University of Warsaw. She deals with conservative treatment and microscopic endodontics. She looks at the patient comprehensively, tries to make her works durable and aesthetic, and the treatment minimally invasive. She broadens her skills and knowledge at numerous dental courses and conferences.', 'Wojniak Iga', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'iga-wojniak-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 18:23:31', '2023-09-27 16:23:31', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1109', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1110, 6, '2023-09-25 13:11:52', '2023-09-25 11:11:52', 'A Dental Medical Doctor and a specialist in dental surgery. He is a graduate of the Faculty of Dentistry at the Warsaw Medical Academy. He studied in the years 1989-1994. Between 1994 and 2006 he worked full-time as an Assistant at the Dental Surgery Unit of the Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery Department at the Warsaw Medical Academy. In 1998 he passed the 1st degree specialist dental surgery examination and in 2001 he received the title of a 2nd degree specialist in dental surgery. He has for many years actively participated in trainings, symposia and lectures in Poland and abroad, focusing on dental implantology. Piotr is a member of the Polish Association of Dental Implantology.', 'Wieczorek Piotr', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'piotr-wieczorek-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 17:21:59', '2023-09-27 15:21:59', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1110', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1111, 6, '2023-09-25 13:12:19', '2023-09-25 11:12:19', '<div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">\r\n\r\nA graduate of the Łódź Medical Academy. She received her Dental Medical Doctor degree in 1992. Edyta owns 2nd degree of specialisation in dental prosthetics. She has participated in numerous trainings and symposia on prosthetics and implantology. Dentist -  she specializes mainly in aesthetic dentistry (porcelain veneers, all-ceramic crowns, implant-based restorations) and occlusal disorders.\r\n\r\n</div>', 'Tyfa Edyta', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'edyta-tyfa-en', '', '', '2024-10-24 19:20:19', '2024-10-24 17:20:19', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1111', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1112, 6, '2023-09-25 13:12:44', '2023-09-25 11:12:44', '<div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">\r\n\r\nShe is a graduate of the medical and dental faculty of the Medical University of Warsaw. She is a supporter of minimally invasive dentistry. She treats her profession as a vocation and approaches it with full commitment. She likes working with people and cares for good contact with the patient. She approaches each one individually taking into account her needs and expectations. She constantly improves her qualifications by participating in numerous courses and trainings. In everyday work, she deals with conservative dentistry with particular emphasis on aesthetics and restoration of the proper function of the teeth. She is interested in the issues of occlusion in cooperation with a physiotherapist. Privately, mother of Tosia and Frank. She likes spend time actively with her family, relax near nature and travel on her own.\r\n\r\n</div>', 'Tuczapska Agnieszka', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'agnieszka-tuczapska-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 17:20:33', '2023-09-27 15:20:33', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1112', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1113, 6, '2023-09-25 13:13:05', '2023-09-25 11:13:05', '<div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">\r\n\r\nArtur is a graduate of the Łódź Medical Academy, which he completed in 1986. Between 1987 and 2004 he worked as a senior assistant at the Unit of Dental Prosthetics, Polyclinic of the Central Clinical Hospital of the Warsaw Medical Academy, where he obtained 2nd degree of specialisation in dental prosthetics. He also undertook teaching activities as a director of specialisations for other doctors. At Villa Nova Dental Clinic he specialises in prosthetics.\r\n\r\n</div>', 'Temczuk Artur', '', 'private', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'artur-temczuk-en', '', '', '2024-11-22 09:58:41', '2024-11-22 08:58:41', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1113', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1114, 6, '2023-09-25 13:13:26', '2023-09-25 11:13:26', '<div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">\r\n\r\nShe completed the Faculty of Dentistry and Medicine at the Medical University of Warsaw with a very good result. Since 2006 she has been a member of the Polish Orthodontic Society. Since 2008, a resident of the Unit of Orthodontics at the Medical University of Warsaw with an open specialisation. She co-authored several scientific publications in the field of orthodontics, published in Poland and abroad. She constantly furthers her qualifications by participating in numerous orthodontic courses and trainings.\r\n\r\n</div>', 'Romanowska Anna', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'anna-romanowska-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 17:20:20', '2023-09-27 15:20:20', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1114', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1115, 6, '2023-09-25 14:08:43', '2023-09-25 12:08:43', 'A graduate of the Warsaw Medical Academy, he received his Dental Medical Doctor degree in 2005. Piotr specialises in advanced microscopic endodontics and conservative dentistry.\r\n\r\nHe is also interested in dental surgery and has participated in numerous courses and conferences in these fields.', 'Płatos Piotr', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'piotr-platos-en', '', '', '2025-07-23 23:03:46', '2025-07-23 21:03:46', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1115', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1116, 6, '2023-09-25 13:14:48', '2023-09-25 11:14:48', 'A graduate of the Faculty of Medicine and Dentistry at the Medical University of Lódź. She graduated with honors. She constantly expanding her knowledge by participating in numerous courses and trainings.\r\nAt Villa Nova Dental Clinic, she deals with conservative dentistry and pediatric dentistry. She is also interested in aesthetic medicine.\r\nPrivately, a lover of cooking and running.', 'Niemiec Dominika', '', 'private', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'dominika-niemiec-en', '', '', '2024-11-22 09:57:48', '2024-11-22 08:57:48', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1116', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1117, 6, '2023-09-25 13:15:09', '2023-09-25 11:15:09', '<div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">\r\n\r\nDr. Niedzielska-Widomska is a graduate of the Lublin Medical Academy, which she completed in 2002 with distinction. In 2006 she successfully defended her PhD thesis at the Medical University of Lublin, Unit of Dental and Maxillofacial Diagnostic Radiology, and was awarded the degree of Doctor of Medical Science. In 2005 she began specialty training in orthodontics at the Medical University of Warsaw and after passing the National Specialty Examination, she received the title of a specialist orthodontist. Dr. Niedzielska-Widomska participated in a number of trainings and conferences in the field of orthodontics. She is a member of the Polish Orthodontic Society and the Section of Maxillofacial Orthopaedics and Orthodontics of the Polish Association of Stomatology.\r\n\r\n</div>', 'Niedzielska-Widomska Agnieszka', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'agnieszka-niedzielska-widomska-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 17:20:04', '2023-09-27 15:20:04', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1117', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1118, 6, '2023-09-25 13:15:30', '2023-09-25 11:15:30', 'He graduated from the Medical University of Karol Marcinkowski in Poznań. During his studies he was on a scholarship of the UMP Rector scholarship for the best students) and was a member of the Board of the Polish Society of Dentistry Students. After completing a postgraduate internship and passing the Medical and Dental Final Examination, he began to specialize in maxillofacial surgery.\r\nCurrently, he is undergoing a specialization training in maxillofacial surgery as part of his residency at the University Clinical Center of the Medical University of Warsaw in the Department of Craniomaxillofacial and Oral Surgery with Implantology. Participant of numerous courses in the field of dental surgery, implantology and reconstructive surgery in Poland and abroad.', 'Mikołajczyk Filip', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'filip-mikolajczyk-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 17:19:58', '2023-09-27 15:19:58', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1118', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1119, 6, '2023-09-25 13:16:02', '2023-09-25 11:16:02', 'She graduated from the Warsaw Medical University in 2007. In 2013, she obtained the title of specialist in pediatric dentistry, passing the State Specialization Exam with the best result in the country. Ambitious and conscientious – she constantly improves her qualifications and deepens her knowledge at courses and trainings. She is also a co-author of several scientific papers in the field of pedodontics.\r\n\r\nAt Villa Nova Dental Clinic, he deals with the conservative treatment of adults and children.', 'Michałek-Pasternak Ewa', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'ewa-michalek-pasternak-en', '', '', '2024-01-04 07:06:56', '2024-01-04 06:06:56', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1119', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1121, 6, '2023-09-25 13:51:32', '2023-09-25 11:51:32', '<div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">\r\n\r\nA graduate of the Warsaw Medical Academy. She received her Dental Medical Doctor degree in 1992. Izabela improves her skills by attending numerous courses and trainings. At Villa Nova Dental Clinic she specialises in endodontic treatment with the use of a microscope, as well as in conservative dentistry.\r\n\r\n</div>', 'Michalik Izabela', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'izabela-michalik-en', '', '', '2023-10-12 08:10:49', '2023-10-12 06:10:49', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1121', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1122, 6, '2023-09-25 13:52:06', '2023-09-25 11:52:06', 'A graduate of the Faculty of Medicine and Dentistry at the Medical University of Warsaw. He participated in many foreign internships and courses, among others at the University of New York (NYU) and the University of California (UCLA). He is fluent in English.\r\n\r\nIn his daily work he makes  beautiful smiles through digital planning and diagnostics. He creates one of a kind and individual smiles using veneers and all the latest prosthetic solutions, trying to exceed expectations. His focus is on cooperation with the patient, consistency and meticulousness. He always strives to achieve the goals set together with a patient. He uses tools that make visualizing the future effect of treatment possible and effortless.', 'Matejkowski Bartosz', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'bartosz-matejkowski-en', '', '', '2024-02-19 18:38:45', '2024-02-19 17:38:45', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1122', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1123, 6, '2023-09-25 13:52:33', '2023-09-25 11:52:33', 'Dentist, specialist in maxillofacial surgery, graduated in 2011, obtained specialization in 2014 at the Military Medical Academy in Saint Petersburg\r\n\r\nAt Villa Nova, she treats children and adults. She performs treatments with the use of autologous growth factor concentrate (CGF) and CD34 + cells from the patient’s own blood.\r\n\r\nShe performs treatments on maxillary sinuses, implantation, bone regeneration, extractions of impacted teeth and primary teeth.', 'Kiworkowa-Turkowska Julietta', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'julietta-kiworkowa-turkowska-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 21:13:32', '2023-09-27 19:13:32', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1123', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1124, 6, '2023-09-25 13:53:07', '2023-09-25 11:53:07', 'A graduate of the Medical University of Warsaw. She obtained her dentist’s diploma in 2018.\r\nParticipant of numerous trainings and conferences in the field of orthodontics, which has become her professional passion. Member of the Polish Orthodontic Society.', 'Smolinska (Dral) Jarmila', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'jarmila-dral-en', '', '', '2023-10-13 11:57:13', '2023-10-13 09:57:13', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1124', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1125, 6, '2023-09-25 13:53:34', '2023-09-25 11:53:34', 'She graduated from the Pomeranian Medical University in Szczecin at the Faculty of Medicine and Dentistry (2006). She specializes in periodontics. Long-term cooperation with the Mazovian Center of Dentistry resulted in extensive experience and treatment of patients at the highest level.', 'Czerniak-Płatos Justyna', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'justyna-czerniak-platos-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 17:19:26', '2023-09-27 15:19:26', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1125', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1126, 6, '2023-09-25 13:58:04', '2023-09-25 11:58:04', 'A graduate of the Medical University of Warsaw, he obtained his diploma in 2004. Between 2007 and 2009 he received specialty training at the Mother and Child Institute (Unit of Maxillofacial Abnormalities, Cleft Defect Counselling Centre) – treatment of children with birth defects, including clefts. Since 2009 he has been continuing his speciality training in the Unit of Orthodontics at the Medical University of Warsaw. He completed his specialty training in 2012 with a national examination, obtaining the second-best result in Poland. For several years now, he has been one of the few orthodontists in Poland to treat occlusal abnormalities with the lingual Incognito appliance system. Rafał participated in many trainings in the field of orthodontics, which is his passion.\r\n\r\nAt Villa Nova Dental Clinic he specialises in orthodontics. He speaks fluent English.', 'Brandt Rafał', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'rafal-brandt-en', '', '', '2025-07-23 23:03:11', '2025-07-23 21:03:11', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1126', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1127, 6, '2023-09-25 13:54:22', '2023-09-25 11:54:22', 'A graduate of the Faculty of Medicine and Dentistry at the Medical University of Poznań. She graduated with honors in 2015. In 2021. Obtained the title of specialist in prosthetics.\r\nShe participates in numerous dental courses and congresses, during which she constantly improves his knowledge and practical skills.\r\nIn the clinic, works in conservative dentistry and prosthetics.', 'Bogdańska Joanna', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'joanna-bogdanska-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 17:19:14', '2023-09-27 15:19:14', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1127', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1128, 6, '2023-09-25 13:54:47', '2023-09-25 11:54:47', 'A graduate of the Lithuanian University of Health Sciences. I obtained a diploma in dentist in 2017. Already in college, orthodontics was my greatest interest, which is why I wrote my Master’s thesis in this field – I obtained the scholarship and first place with this work. I am also satisfied with the work at Fundacji Wiewiórkii Julii. Privately I am a fan of travel and coffee.', 'Bobin Dalia', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'dalia-bobin-en', '', '', '2023-09-28 13:26:32', '2023-09-28 11:26:32', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1128', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1129, 6, '2023-09-25 13:55:09', '2023-09-25 11:55:09', 'Having completed her studies at the Faculty of Dentistry in 2000, Karolina has participated in numerous congresses and symposia on prosthetics, implantology, and above all, aesthetic dentistry. She puts particular emphasis on precision and strict adherence to planning and execution procedures.\r\n\r\nShe has wide knowledge of modern composite technologies and dental ceramics, as well as exceptional intuition in smile aesthetics planning. She is also a specialist in cosmetic dentistry computer imaging and a member of the Polish Academy of Aesthetic Dentistry. Apart from her work as a doctor, her interests include artistic photography, computer graphics and sport aviation.', 'Badowska Karolina', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'karolina-badowska-en', '', '', '2025-07-23 12:42:08', '2025-07-23 10:42:08', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1129', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1130, 6, '2023-09-25 13:59:38', '2023-09-25 11:59:38', 'Anna graduated from the Białystok Medical Academy in 2005. She constantly develops her interests in the area of microscopic endodontics. She participates in many courses and conferences in Poland and abroad.\r\n\r\nAt Villa Nova Dental Clinic she specialises in aesthetic conservative restoration and endodontics. She is also a horse riding and hippotherapy instructor.', 'Jankowska Anna', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'anna-jankowska-en', '', '', '2025-07-23 23:03:32', '2025-07-23 21:03:32', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1130', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1131, 6, '2023-09-25 13:56:07', '2023-09-25 11:56:07', 'Beata completed the Lublin Medical Academy in 2001. Since 2003 she has been working as a research assistant at the Department of Dental Prosthetics, Dentistry Institute of the Medical University of Warsaw. In 2007 she began her specialty training in dental prosthetics. She participated in over 30 academic conferences and practical trainings, mainly in the field of dental prosthetics. She is an author of several scientific publications and a member of the Polish Association of Stomatology, Prosthetic Section and OSIS (Polish Association of Dental Implantology).', 'Borsuk-Nastaj Beata', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'beata-borsuk-nastaj-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 17:18:50', '2023-09-27 15:18:50', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1131', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
 (1132, 6, '2023-09-25 13:56:30', '2023-09-25 11:56:30', 'Dr. Emma Kiworkowa obtained her High School Diploma in Middletown High School, USA. In 2001 she graduated from the Warsaw Medical Academy and 5 years later she defended her doctoral thesis at the Lublin Medical Academy. She participated in over 40 trainings in the field of orthodontics, in which she began her specialty training in 2004. She co-authored 10 scientific papers and many convention communications devoted to the role of radiological diagnostics in dentistry and orthodontics, as well as other topics. She translated several chapters from the “Dental radiology” textbook, edited by Prof. T.K. Różyło. She speaks Polish, English and Russian fluently, and has very good command of German and French. She is a co-owner of Villa Nova Dental Clinic and a leader of the orthodontic team.', 'Kiworkowa Emma', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'emma-kiworkowa-en', '', '', '2023-09-27 17:18:42', '2023-09-27 15:18:42', '', 0, 'https://villanova.imperit.pl/?post_type=zespol&#038;p=1132', 0, 'zespol', '', 0),
