 (1432, 2, '2023-10-19 14:00:22', '2023-10-19 12:00:22', '43 years old\r\n\r\nEstate agent.\r\n\r\nThe constant rush at work and in life led Urszula to neglect her teeth. She and her husband will soon celebrate their 10th wedding anniversary. She came to Villa Nova Dental Clinic, determined to improve the condition of her teeth to delight her husband with a new, wonderful smile. To meet Urszula\'s expectations, multi-stage treatment was needed, which the heroine of our metamorphosis endured patiently and cheerfully.\r\n\r\nTreatments performed:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Hygienization</li>\r\n 	<li>Basic dental treatment</li>\r\n 	<li>Whitening</li>\r\n 	<li>Porcelain veneers in the upper arch</li>\r\n 	<li>Bonding in the lower arch</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n(This photo is the result of individual treatment and requires a comprehensive approach to the patient, without the possibility of guaranteeing the effect as in the photo.)', 'Urszula', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'urszula-2', '', '', '2023-10-19 14:00:51', '2023-10-19 12:00:51', '', 0, 'https://villanova.pl/?post_type=metamorfoza&#038;p=1432', 0, 'metamorfoza', '', 0),
